{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c2a1b9f0-code-4tp4-9d31-20260731135914",
    "name": "课程编号-缺编号数据刷新",
    "description": "## 变更摘要\n\n- 新增/修改课程时，实践教学计划与实践项目(type=2/4)按与其它类型相同的规则生成课程编号(原 type=4 insert 时跳过致 code 恒空)。\n- 新增 `POST /curriculum/course/refreshCode` 统一刷新历史缺编号老数据；所需字段(version/collegeName/educationLevel)为空则跳过该条。\n\n## 课程编号规则\n编号 = 版本(2位) + 培训层次(代码) + 开课单位(代码) + 流水号(4位)\n前缀由 GenerateCourseCodeUtils.getPrefixCode_new(version, collegeName, educationLevel) 生成；流水号取该前缀下已有编号最大值+1。\n\n基址变量：`{{baseUrl}}`，如 `http://host:8080/flowable-demo`。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/flowable-demo", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "刷新缺课程编号的源库课程",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}", "type": "text", "description": "鉴权令牌(按网关实际填写)" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/curriculum/course/refreshCode",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["curriculum", "course", "refreshCode"]
        },
        "description": "统一刷新缺课程编号(code 为空)的源库课程(source_id 为空)编号。\n\n规则同新增：版本(2位)-培训层次(代码)-开课单位(代码)-流水号(4位)。\n- version / collegeName(或 collegeId 可解析) / educationLevel 任一为空 -> 跳过该条(skippedNoField++)。\n- 幂等：只处理 code 为空的课程，可重复调用。\n- 用于补 type=2/4 等历史缺编号老数据(type=1/3 老数据缺编号也一并补)。\n\n无入参。"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "刷新成功(部分字段空跳过)",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/curriculum/course/refreshCode", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["curriculum", "course", "refreshCode"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json;charset=UTF-8" }],
          "cookie": [],
          "body": "{\n  \"code\": 200,\n  \"msg\": \"操作成功\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"detected\": 36,\n    \"refreshed\": 30,\n    \"skippedNoField\": 6\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "无缺编号数据",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/curriculum/course/refreshCode", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["curriculum", "course", "refreshCode"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json;charset=UTF-8" }],
